  "sourceTitle": "Black Olive Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Black Olive Salsa\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 26, 2009 - 12:27am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 pounds tomatoes chopped\n1 1/2 cups black olives sliced\n1/4 cup onion diced\n1/2 cup fresh cilantro chopped\n1 tablespoon basil vinegar (or regular vinegar)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients and chill for several hours in the refrigerator. This is the preferred salsa for tacos on southern Arizona ranches. 2 Makes 3&1/2 cups",
